 willalso help track your training progress, but they're not essentialfor these plans."},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"text","orig":"Thesetraining zones are onlya sodon'tworry about being overly precise with heart rates because they'll fluctuate anyway. Its goodto be mindfulofyour intensity but it's even more important that you outthere andenjoyyour training. guide, get","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":612.5564371744791,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":309.3333333333333,"r":538.6666666666666,"t":644.8897705078125},"charspan":[0,239],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/33","text":"Thesetraining zones are onlya sodon'tworry about being overly precise with heart rates because they'll fluctuate anyway. Its goodto be mindfulofyour intensity but it's even more important that you outthere andenjoyyour training. guide, get"},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"section_header","level":1,"orig":"ZONE1 [Zl] Recovery","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":599.2231038411459,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":309.3333333333333,"r":378.0,"t":608.8897705078125},"charspan":[0,19],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/34","text":"ZONE1 [Zl] Recovery"},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"text","orig":"60t0 65% ofyour maximum. Easy pace, feels nice and light.","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":591.5564371744791,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":309.3333333333333,"r":486.6666666666667,"t":601.2231038411459},"charspan":[0,57],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/35","text":"60t0 65% ofyour maximum. Easy pace, feels nice and light."},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"text","orig":"65t0 75% ofyour maximum: Fairly easy pace; Easy enough so that you could breathejust through your nose ifyou wanted to","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":563.2231038411458,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":309.6666666666667,"r":537.6666666666666,"t":581.8897705078125},"charspan":[0,118],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/36",